          {
            "id": "/page/881/Text/17",
            "block_type": "Text",
            "html": "<p block-type=\"Text\"><i>(b)</i> Plates that have been given the full heat treatment required by para. 8.2.1 or 8.2.2 shall be marked by the party performing the heat treatment with the letters designating the applicable heat treatment condition in Table 4 of EN 10028-3 following the stamped steel name or number.</p>",
