            "id": "/page/881/Text/21",
            "block_type": "Text",
            "html": "<p block-type=\"Text\"><i>(d)</i> Plates that are not heat treated but are qualified on the basis of heat treated specimens per para. 8.2.3 shall be stamped with letter \"G\" following the stamped specification designation.</p>",
